# r1106spf shared probes: run on boot 0 (installed jars, ids get "-base") and boot 1 (18:5x builds); the two
# RES/rows/<ID>.log files are compared line by line in the judge step (tools/scratch_query/batches/r1106spf/compare.py).
pace 1

